        "memo": "Resolver capability owned by the Wikipedia Article Source class. Given an article ref, resolve canonical Wikipedia identity, revision metadata, attribution, lead content, first useful section, and the section manifest. Runtime lifecycle integration is still required before this can execute automatically for each article instance.",
